menu "Board support"

    config BSP_BRINGUP_CHECKS
        bool "Report I2C pin state and scan the bus"
        default y
        help
            Logs whether each I2C line has an external pull-up, and offers
            bsp_i2c_scan(). Bring-up only: the pin report reconfigures SDA and
            SCL as plain GPIO on the way into bsp_board_init.

endmenu
